{
  "name": "05 - Sentiment Analysis Router",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Sentiment Analysis Router\n**Nodes explored:** Webhook, LangChain LLM Chain, OpenAI Chat Model, Code, Switch, Set (multiple), Respond to Webhook\n\n**What it does:** Classifies incoming text as positive/neutral/negative, scores confidence, and routes to different handling branches — demonstrating conditional logic and multi-branch flows.\n\n**Test it:**\n```\nPOST http://localhost:5678/webhook/sentiment\n{ \"text\": \"I absolutely love this product, it changed my life!\", \"context\": \"product review\" }\n```\n\n**Setup:** Set OpenAI credential on 'OpenAI Chat Model' node",
        "height": 372,
        "width": 600,
        "color": 2
      },
      "id": "fe95bc11-9962-4036-993c-dab14e30358c",
      "name": "Sticky Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1008,
        240
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "sentiment",
        "responseMode": "responseNode",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "8d849b30-031e-4444-9bc7-6ecdd4be91fe",
      "name": "Webhook",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        1248,
        640
      ],
      "webhookId": "sentiment-webhook"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=Context: {{ $json.body.context || 'general' }}\n\nText to analyze:\n{{ $json.body.text }}",
        "messages": {
          "messageValues": [
            {
              "message": "You are a sentiment analysis API. Analyze the given text and return ONLY a valid JSON object with:\n- sentiment: exactly one of \"positive\", \"neutral\", or \"negative\"\n- confidence: float between 0.0 and 1.0\n- emotions: array of up to 3 detected emotions (strings)\n- reason: one sentence explaining the classification\n\nReturn ONLY JSON. No markdown. No explanation."
            }
          ]
        },
        "batching": {}
      },
      "id": "f53b38a2-ae54-4330-bbb2-562964be01aa",
      "name": "Classify Sentiment",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.chainLlm",
      "typeVersion": 1.9,
      "position": [
        1488,
        640
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "model": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "gpt-3.5-turbo",
          "mode": "list",
          "cachedResultName": "gpt-3.5-turbo"
        },
        "builtInTools": {},
        "options": {
          "maxTokens": 300,
          "temperature": 0.1
        }
      },
      "id": "2b97b265-8289-4d23-bfdb-7d9ca195c659",
      "name": "OpenAI Chat Model",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.lmChatOpenAi",
      "typeVersion": 1.3,
      "position": [
        1488,
        864
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "openAiApi": {
          "id": "1wlvouYpfDOUpKFI",
          "name": "OpenAi account 2"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "// chainLlm output field varies by n8n version\nconst raw = $json.output\n          || $json.text\n          || $json.response\n          || $json.message?.content\n          || $json.content\n          || '';\n\nconst original_text = $('Webhook').first().json.body.text;\n\nlet result;\ntry {\n  const cleaned = String(raw).replace(/```(?:json)?\\n?/g, '').replace(/```$/g, '').trim();\n  result = JSON.parse(cleaned);\n} catch (e) {\n  result = { sentiment: 'neutral', confidence: 0.5, emotions: [], reason: 'Parse error' };\n}\n\nreturn [{ json: { ...result, original_text, analyzed_at: new Date().toISOString() } }];"
      },
      "id": "6e406a50-30f1-4cf2-b10a-2429c0fc7b80",
      "name": "Parse Classification",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        1760,
        640
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rules": {
          "values": [
            {
              "conditions": {
                "options": {
                  "caseSensitive": false,
                  "leftValue": "",
                  "typeValidation": "loose"
                },
                "conditions": [
                  {
                    "leftValue": "={{ $json.sentiment }}",
                    "rightValue": "positive",
                    "operator": {
                      "type": "string",
                      "operation": "equals"
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "combinator": "and"
              },
              "renameOutput": true,
              "outputKey": "positive"
            },
            {
              "conditions": {
                "options": {
                  "caseSensitive": false,
                  "leftValue": "",
                  "typeValidation": "loose"
                },
                "conditions": [
                  {
                    "leftValue": "={{ $json.sentiment }}",
                    "rightValue": "neutral",
                    "operator": {
                      "type": "string",
                      "operation": "equals"
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "combinator": "and"
              },
              "renameOutput": true,
              "outputKey": "neutral"
            },
            {
              "conditions": {
                "options": {
                  "caseSensitive": false,
                  "leftValue": "",
                  "typeValidation": "loose"
                },
                "conditions": [
                  {
                    "leftValue": "={{ $json.sentiment }}",
                    "rightValue": "negative",
                    "operator": {
                      "type": "string",
                      "operation": "equals"
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "combinator": "and"
              },
              "renameOutput": true,
              "outputKey": "negative"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
